1
00:00:00,356 --> 00:00:04,446
You know, in Girl Scouts, Tammie Dineesha
said you could do that with panty hose.

2
00:00:05,236 --> 00:00:07,066
(Penny:)Boy, was she wrong.

3
00:00:09,240 --> 00:00:10,780
Anyway, you wanna make out?

4
00:00:12,034 --> 00:00:16,084
(Leonard:)I thought because our relationship's in
a beta test, you wanted to take things slow.

5
00:00:16,622 --> 00:00:19,212
Okay. Do you wanna make out slow?

6
00:00:21,294 --> 00:00:24,964
(Leonard:)I can go so slow it'll be like
there's a snail in your mouth.

7
00:00:26,841 --> 00:00:28,471
(Leonard:)Oh...

8
00:00:31,012 --> 00:00:33,512
(Penny:)Lucky for you
there's nothing else to do right now.

9
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,690
- Excuse me, Leonard.
- Since when don't you knock?

10
00:00:38,853 --> 00:00:40,983
(Leonard:)It's, like, the only good thing about you.

11
00:00:41,898 --> 00:00:45,278
(Sheldon:)Social niceties have been suspended.
We're in a state of emergency.

12
00:00:45,902 --> 00:00:48,482
(Sheldon:)The world has descended
into darkened turmoil...

13
00:00:48,654 --> 00:00:52,034
(Sheldon:)...lawlessness and savagery
are the order of the day.

14
00:00:52,825 --> 00:00:54,995
- Fine, what is it?
- I'm making s'mores.

15
00:00:56,495 --> 00:00:59,835
(Sheldon:)I wanted to alert you in case you smelled
caramelizing marshmallows...

